    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24903" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακαρτερ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>endure to the end,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.52
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὸ ἔσχατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.107
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὴν πατρίδα δ.</span>
			<i>stand by</i> one's country, <i><span class="en">
				Lycurg.
				85
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇ συμμαχίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					7.2.1
				</span></i>
			: c. part., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ.
			πολεμῶν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.8
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sert.</u>
				7
			</span></i>: c. inf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. μὴ λέγειν
				τἀληθῆ</span>
			<i>to be obstinate</i> in refusing to speak the truth, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
			</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1377a4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.,
